# From "Exploring Focus 15" (Wave V - Exploring Focus 15, CD3-6). A free
# period at F15, framed around intuition, creation, and stillness -- the
# capstone of the wave, tying discovering-intuition.gws, exploring-
# intuition.gws, and mission-15-creation-and-manifestation.gws together.

@segment  exploring-focus-15
@title    Exploring Focus 15
@levels   F15
@duration ~5m

say You're free to explore the far reaches of Focus 15 now. The nature of your own intuition. The creative energy within you. Your true essence. Or simply the stillness that lives deep inside you.
pause 8
say I'll call you when it's time to return, and you'll remember everything you find in detail.
hold 180
say Begin returning now.
pause 6
